      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ac3b9983f8d523278a405d4|full_name}: i'm looking for something similar to what Bigscreen does on Steam, allowing for the Oculus version to be run from steam, bypassing steamvr but still logging hours on steam ^^",
