  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-26T12:25:35.027Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "i have a not amazing pc, and a rift s. the ability to launch the game through oculus on steam, would allow me to keep my playtime accurate on steam, while not having to play through both the steamvr AND oculus compositor, with the downside of not being able to use any ovr overlays like fpsVR or OVR Toolkit. if you're completely confused as to what i mean, take bigscreen beta as an example. installed on steam you can launch it through oculus and have steam still count your hours ^^",
